// Bandit Level 4 → Level 5

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 4 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit4@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 3.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: The directory `inhere` is present. Enter the directory:

        cd inhere

Step5: List all files in the directory:

        ls -la

Step6: There are several files with different file types. We need to find the only human-readable file.

Step7: Use the `file` command to identify the type of each file:

        file ./*

Step8: Find the file identified as ASCII text. In this level, the file is:

        ./-file07

Step9: Read the contents of the file:

        cat ./-file07

Step10: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit5`.

Step11: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit5@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step12: The Bandit Level 4 → Level 5 challenge is solved.

Step13: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
